# Task 154-002 Execution Plan

## Goal
Add 6 new scorer functions to src/orchestra/result-evaluator.ts following the existing pattern (scoreCorrectness, scoreDocumentation).

## Approach
1. Import readFileSync from node:fs (already use node:fs/promises but need sync read for scorers per task spec)
2. Add 6 scorer functions, all returning RubricScore { criterion, score, passed, reason }:
   - scoreWordCount(result, task) — DOC_WRITE_RUBRIC criterion 'word_count'
   - scoreAuditCompleteness(result, task) — AUDIT_RUBRIC criterion 'audit_completeness'
   - scoreFindingCount(result, task) — AUDIT_RUBRIC criterion 'finding_count'
   - scoreCitationDensity(result, task) — AUDIT_RUBRIC criterion 'citation_density'
   - scoreMigrationTriage(result, task) — AUDIT_RUBRIC criterion 'migration_triage'
   - scoreDocumentationQuality(result, task) — DOC_WRITE_RUBRIC criterion 'documentation_quality'
3. File-read scorers wrap readFileSync in try/catch, fallback to notes-based scoring
4. `passed` field: each scorer uses a sensible threshold for its own decision (Task 3 will override based on rubric criterion threshold anyway)

## Files Modified
- src/orchestra/result-evaluator.ts (add ~250 LoC, no removals)

